  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Denna insats &#xE4;r en del i ett st&#xF6;rre samarbete med SLU f&#xF6;r Kirgizstan och Tadzdjikistan med flera komponenter: utveckling av uts&#xE4;desindustrin, uts&#xE4;deskontroll och h&#xF6;gre utbildning inom  v&#xE4;xtgenetiska resurser.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This contribution is part of an overall agreement with the Swedish University of Agricultural Sciences (SLU) for Kyrgyzstan&amp;Tajikistan. Funds are divided into three areas with the following  sub-implementers: Seed Industry Development (Niras/Sval&#xF6;f Consulting), Seed Certification &amp; Control (Swedish Board of  Agriculture) and Higher Education in Plant Genetic Resources (SLU)</narrative>
  </description>
